"how_whitelabel_work" = "How does the %@ app work?";
"how_whitelabel_work_answer" = "In %@ you search for and share tips of places, wherever you are. The reviews in the app are tips of your friends or people you follow. This means: relevant and reliable tips. You can add and review your favourite places, but also find places based on a specific, or your current location.";
"how_to_add_tip" = "How to add a tip/review?";
"how_to_add_tip_answer" = "Search for the place you would like tip or review in the Explore tab. Via the search or '+' button on the map or list. Once you’ve found the location, simply give it a rating and a review.";
"how_can_i_search" = "How can I search for reviews?";
"how_can_i_search_answer" = "Use the Explore tab when you are looking for tips nearby or a specific location. When you are on the map, you can also choose to show the tips in a list view. Tap on the icon in the right corner to switch to the list. Use the filter in search to search for specific tips.";
"what_kind_of_tips" = "What kind of tips can I add?";
"what_kind_of_tips_answer" = "You can leave any kind of tip for every location on the map. Think of tips you used to save or share with friends, colleagues or family via other channels. For example, your favourite restaurant you discovered during your trip to Milan last month. The best coffee spot just around the corner of your home. That hidden gallery or B&B your friends just have to check out. A tour or other activity you recommend. But a shop or little market is also a welcome tip. Or a hotel that serves the best breakfast ever, the best spot to work, that beautiful park, quiet little beach…";
"whitelabel_asks_phone" = "Why does %@ ask for my telephone number?";
"whitelabel_asks_phone_answer" = "Creating an account by using your phone number is an easy, fast and safe way to register. Every time you login, we send you a 6-digit code via SMS to enter the app. We only use your phone number to suggest your profile to friends. We don’t use your phone number for marketing or commercial purposes.";
"whitelabel_asks_location" = "Why does %@ ask for access to my location?";
"whitelabel_asks_location_answer" = "Because we want to show you the tips of your friends, based on your location, it’s necessary to know your location. You can always disable location services on your device, or revoke location permission for the app from your device settings.";
"whitelabel_asks_contacts" = "Why does %@ ask for access to my contacts?";
"whitelabel_asks_contacts_answer" = "We only use your contacts to give you suggestions of other users you may know. If you want to follow them, is up to you! We won’t approach your contacts for marketing or commercial purposes.";
"how_can_i_edit" = "How can I edit or delete a review?";
"how_can_i_edit_answer" = "Go to your Profile, tap on 'Reviews'. Now you see an overview of your own reviews. When you tap on the 3 dots on top right of your review, you can choose for the options: Edit review or Delete review.";
"how_can_i_edit_answer_ios" = "Go to your Profile. Here you see an overview of your own reviews. Open the review you want to edit or delete. When you tap on the 3 dots on top right of your review, you can choose for the options: Edit review or Delete review.";
"how_can_i_change" = "How can I change my e-mail address or phone number?";
"how_can_i_change_answer" = "Change (or add) your e-mail address or phone number in your profile. You can find your profile via the tab bar. When you are in your profile, tap on the button ‘Edit Profile’.";
"who_can_find_me" = "Who can find me on %@?";
"who_can_find_me_answer" = "Only users of GoHere apps can find you and (optionally) follow you. Via ‘My profile’ you can choose to make your profile private. This means that you have to accept other users follow requests, before they are allowed to follow you.";
"how_can_a_friend" = "How can a friend and I see each other in 2 different apps?";
"how_can_a_friend_answer" = "There is more than 1 app where you can login with the credentials of the app you use right now. There can be a difference in look and feel, but also the content of these apps can be different. But in every app you are logged into, you will always see the same friends who are following you, and the same friends you follow. The tips from our other platforms are often used to provide a better experience where possible, we want you to get your friends’ tips!";
"your_own_gohere_app" = "Your own GoHere App?";
"your_own_gohere_app_answer" = "GoHere offers (travel) organizations and companies the opportunity to launch an app with their own tips for their target group, within their corporate identity.";
"how_can_contact" = "How can I contact GoHere?";
"how_can_contact_answer" = "Please send your question, comment or feedback to info@gohere.app";
"how_can_follow_friend" = "How can I follow friends?";
"how_can_follow_friend_answer" = "Go to your profile. Tap on followers or followings. Via ‘More friends’ you can search friends by name. Tap on the follow button behind his or her name to follow!";
